Package: survey160r
Title: R Client for Survey160 Data
Version: 0.7.1
Authors@R: c(
    person("Lennon", "Shimokawa", email = "lshimokawa@survey160.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
    )
Description: Access Survey160 campaign data from R. Supports reading
    campaign results from Google Cloud Storage, triggering fresh exports
    via the Survey160 API, and computing per-campaign latency reports
    written as Parquet to GCS.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/survey160/survey160r
BugReports: https://github.com/survey160/survey160r/issues
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.1)
Imports:
    googleCloudStorageR (>= 0.7.0),
    httr,
    jsonlite,
    arrow,
    lubridate,
    yaml,
    digest,
    dplyr,
    rlang
Suggests:
    askpass,
    duckdb,
    DBI,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    mockery,
    withr,
    lintr,
    covr
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
